# Test coverage
# ANCHORED (leading slash). Unanchored, `coverage/` matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth — which silently swallowed the API route
# `tec-frontend/src/app/api/admin/pioneers/coverage/`. `git add -A` said
# nothing, the tests passed locally because the file was on disk, and CI failed
# on a file it had never been given. Only build output is meant here.
/coverage/
tec-frontend/coverage/
.nyc_output/

